  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1...\nWidely scattered showers and isolated thunderstorms are \nforecasted for Monday and Tuesday as a cold front and associated\nupper level disturbance pass across the lower Mid-Atlantic.\n\nWith dry and near seasonal temperatures forecasted through \nSunday night, widely scattered showers and isolated \nthunderstorms will return to the lower Mid-Atlantic on Monday \nand Tuesday as a cold front and associated upper level \ndisturbance pass across the region. Given the lack of deep\nmoisture returning to the region, any rainfall is forecasted to\nremain brief in duration, with most totals of less than 0.10\". \nLikewise, any storms that develop are not expected to become \nsevere. Dry conditions are expected for the Wednesday through \nFriday time period.",
